.git
.gitignore
.vscode
README.md
LICENSE
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
pyproject.toml
logs/*
data/*
www/*
postgres_data/*
postgres_logs/*
*.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# NOTE: .ssh, requirements.txt, requirements-modules.txt, routes.yaml,
# supervisord.conf, docker-entrypoint.sh and scripts/ are intentionally NOT
# ignored — the build needs them. addons/ is NOT copied into the image (it's
# bind-mounted at runtime, see docker-compose.yml) but isn't excluded here
# either — harmless in the build context either way. The openclaw/ sibling
# build context no longer has its own .ssh — it shares the repo-root ./.ssh
# via a runtime bind mount instead (see docker-compose.yml).

# pi sibling — its build context and deps are handled by pi/Dockerfile;
# keep node_modules/dist out of the ROOT build context (the gateway builds
# use context=. and would otherwise upload the whole tree).
pi/node_modules
pi/dist
pi/*.tsbuildinfo
